{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033459_c9011fb9","chunk_index":19,"job_id":"mwjob_6ea88e6715579409992c43ee","precondition_digest":"968aabd6184f764b8be1b297092e19b0d5f45b861c3a384214982b8cdb9452d9","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v7","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033459_c9011fb9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","quote":"章节编号=12.1\n章节标题=研究方案的依从","quote_sha256":"7a701c833fc23be3666f8de851226122f1436afbf1a0b43252a750161a029826","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","span_id":"span_sec_12_1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f99734c87881f7d6c64a1421824e8d63df9b86db797b44cc550ce00fc96423c7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_treatment"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"bae98d5756fc33d2dec389859c413b44261174683ee2abd68620571e65357c06","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_compliance"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。","quote_sha256":"63eabad83df6668ab707ddc556cc8da06b6cd29646215ef8e6dab242db644044","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_visits"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","quote":"使每个参研人员都对临床研究方案及其各指标具体内涵有充分理解和认识、掌握 GCP 原则、统一记录方式与判断标准、严格按照方案执行。培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前进行。","quote_sha256":"c404f5fe8927e3c9a69e220eb610fcd15a3038966341cb9afc3a8747c1e3f983","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","span_id":"span_training"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我将根据中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案的要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。","quote_sha256":"847870399c3f76fdc0bcc09dbcc4a9c08ea59bdd15bf132b3a06af7580781493","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"span_crf"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_12_1","span_project_treatment","span_project_compliance","span_project_visits","span_training","span_gcp","span_crf"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"研究方案的依从","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他适用的法律法规开展。研究开始前，必须通过启动会或研究者会议对所有参加研究的人员进行研究方案培训，使参研人员充分理解研究方案及其各指标具体内涵，掌握GCP原则，统一记录方式与判断标准，并严格按照方案执行；培训必须在该临床试验机构入选受试者之前完成。试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期为16周。受试者的治疗依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价。受试者按照访视策略，在筛选后于基线/第1天随机，并在第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。研究者应按照中国GCP规定中的程序，按本方案要求记录临床研究资料，并保证真实、准确、及时、合法地将该临床研究的资料载入病例报告表。","rationale":"依据已确认研究事实中的依从性评价方式（药品计数及受试者日记）、试验组给药方案和访视安排，以及监管共性来源中关于研究实施遵循GCP/ICH-GCP、研究前培训和研究者记录义务的表述。医学作者需核对：依从性评价的具体阈值与计算方法、受试者日记的填写和审核要求、培训记录归档要求，以及本项目的CRF记录方式。","review_advisories":["本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_41067e2a2f9fda04","section_number":"12.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033459_c9011fb9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","quote":"章节编号=12.2\n章节标题=监查","quote_sha256":"f48aab63aa9268a048ccb5d255b8ed41e1843cbe3b16382e0b953d967303e1cc","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","span_id":"span_sec_12_2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_multicenter"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_project_phase"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"7b5107e534b1945df0f53889ceb8ec820728aa37140ba980bc462ccfc9d5507a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"span_monitoring"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_12_2","span_project_design","span_project_multicenter","span_project_phase","span_monitoring","span_gcp"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"监查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的III期临床研究。按照GCP要求，申办者负责建立并实施监查制度，派遣临床监查员对研究进行监查。研究者同意接受申办者派遣的临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。监查工作应围绕研究是否按照已批准的研究方案、GCP和相关法律法规实施，研究数据的真实性、准确性和完整性，以及受试者权益和安全保护情况开展。研究者及其研究团队应配合监查员的工作，提供研究相关的原始资料、记录和必要说明。申办者应依据监查结果评估研究实施质量，并采取相应措施确保研究符合方案和法规要求。","rationale":"依据已确认研究事实中的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照III期设计和研究者接受监查、稽查及药品管理部门视查的监管共性表述。医学作者需核对：监查频率、监查内容、数据核查范围、监查报告与跟进流程、监查员资质和委派程序。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5bce5a5d2a9cd80f","section_number":"12.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033459_c9011fb9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","quote":"章节编号=12.3\n章节标题=稽查和核查","quote_sha256":"4576e2e4a2fee4e2855c65519edfc574aae09365fd37e59f00c6433ac5d0c4aa","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","span_id":"span_sec_12_3"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","quote":"我同意接受申办者派遣临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。","quote_sha256":"7b5107e534b1945df0f53889ceb8ec820728aa37140ba980bc462ccfc9d5507a","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","span_id":"span_monitoring"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，因此，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。","quote_sha256":"a95f171292054da4c0e730a5808f9cf1db173b3e9368862f63a2a3c3172a88c6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"span_confidentiality"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_12_3","span_monitoring","span_confidentiality","span_gcp"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":3,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"稽查和核查","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的实施应接受申办者组织的稽查以及药品监督管理部门依法开展的核查。研究者同意接受申办者派遣的临床监查员或稽查员对本次临床研究的监查或稽查及药品管理部门的视查，确保临床研究质量。稽查和核查应围绕研究实施是否遵循已批准的研究方案、GCP和相关法律法规，研究记录和数据是否真实、准确、完整，以及受试者权益和安全是否得到保护开展。研究者及其研究团队应配合稽查和核查工作，按照要求提供研究相关的原始资料、记录和必要说明。本方案中所包含的信息归申办方所有，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。","rationale":"依据监管共性来源中研究者接受申办者稽查及药品管理部门视查的表述，以及方案信息供监督管理部门等相关机构审阅的保密范围说明。医学作者需核对：稽查发起条件、稽查员独立性、核查通知与应对流程、记录保存和回复时限。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_6dac26944474f952","section_number":"12.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922033459_c9011fb9","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","quote":"章节编号=12.4\n章节标题=方案偏离","quote_sha256":"8f72e98b8bad2324c18230e4d95d96a9c9d8849b8017540e5eb1f12189a1e3b6","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","span_id":"span_sec_12_4"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","quote":"未经申办者和 EC 的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床 试验管理方面的改动。","quote_sha256":"743910b4d8b1f761043a6c77a60dfa3b62f4d8d4bc0415e5e8d1e9bd1a956b8c","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","span_id":"span_deviation"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","quote":"本研究的实施将严格遵循研究方案、《赫尔辛基宣言》、GCP、ICH-GCP E6（R3）GCP以及其他所有适用的法律法规开展。","quote_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","span_id":"span_gcp"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_12_4","span_deviation","span_gcp"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"方案偏离","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"根据GCP要求，未经申办者和伦理委员会的同意，研究者不得修改或者偏离试验方案，但不包括为了及时消除对受试者的紧急危害或者更换监查员、电话号码等仅涉及临床试验管理方面的改动。在本研究中，方案偏离管理应覆盖受试者筛选、随机、双盲治疗、访视和数据记录等环节。研究者应按照本方案、GCP及相关法律法规要求，对方案偏离进行识别、记录和报告，评估其对受试者安全、权益和研究数据完整性的影响。方案偏离的处理应以保护受试者安全和权益为首要考虑，并有助于维护研究数据的可靠性。","rationale":"依据监管共性来源中未经申办者和伦理委员会同意不得修改或偏离试验方案及紧急情况例外的表述，并结合已确认研究事实中的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照III期设计。医学作者需核对：方案偏离的定义与分类、报告时限、报告路径、评估职责和处理措施。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_8d715f9a6698dbcc","section_number":"12.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:4a24b1d0cd0217473df3fd3b","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"6b801a21cf7c158eeaec249bf45ccd3e21fb5e609cdbac4783c92230d3db3674"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:研究者签字页|block:32|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:544d5795fdc791","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"9d5bb308153441df0cf0a282e48e71b5918f97f81ec06babdf8e969557541291"},{"locator":"section:11.7 方案修订|block:1231|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3d78c7bb1bd24f","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"76042946d5684aaa9636ba63055710074755cd90e1cbcdea361b478c726f510b"},{"locator":"section:9.3 质量控制|block:1182|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5809e9c89c84d","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a668438495209c1a93ff8056f3ef958a45b23c7f699057c8114de2ccc026a93e"},{"locator":"section:研究的伦理指导|block:904|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:cebb133a914e24","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"7efe71dbc609553fdc2a0fa8836b8cd21ab8fdeb657d90ec493ef48b00b6bff8"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd"}]}